    "summary": "这是一个面向“Hero Section”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 dark high-contrast palette、bright neutral canvas，并以“lightweight 3D-inspired depth”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Hero Section 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Build an original, production-ready frontend concept for a fictional hero section. The result must be a fresh implementation, not a textual or visual clone of any existing brand.\n\nTECH STACK\n- React 19 + TypeScript + Vite.\n- Tailwind CSS v4 for styling and responsive layout.\n- motion/react for meaningful interface animation.\n- lucide-react for interface icons; do not use emoji as functional icons.\n- Frontend only. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless explicitly required by the visible UI.\n\nDESIGN DIRECTION\n- Primary composition: a full-viewport opening composition; a centered focal composition.\n- Visual language: dark high-contrast palette; bright neutral canvas.\n- Suggested palette: #505050, #000000, #f8f8f8, #0e1311. Treat these as design tokens and adjust contrast where accessibility requires it.\n- Typography: Inter. Maintain a clear display/body/UI hierarchy.\n- Use a spacious spacing rhythm, a maximum content width of 1180px, and a base surface radius around 12px.\n- Avoid generic gradient blobs, decorative icon grids, excessive glass panels, and random animations that do not reinforce hierarchy.\n\nCONTENT AND STRUCTURE\n- a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point.\n- Create an original fictional brand and concise value proposition; do not reuse trademarked names, slogans, or recognizable marketing copy.\n- Include a compact navigation, one dominant headline, supporting copy, primary and secondary actions, and a visual demonstration or atmospheric focal element.\n- The hero must still communicate clearly if decorative media or advanced motion is disabled.\n- Write concise, specific interface copy. Keep all names and claims fictional, neutral, and replaceable.\n- Use semantic HTML landmarks and keep the document hierarchy understandable without CSS.\n\nINTERACTION AND MOTION\n- Use lightweight 3D-inspired depth as the primary motion vocabulary.\n- Keep ordinary transitions within 280–420ms; reserve longer motion only for deliberate scene changes.\n- Animate opacity and transforms instead of layout-heavy properties. Avoid scroll jank and continuous animation that competes with reading.\n- Support prefers-reduced-motion with stable non-animated states.\n- Every interactive control must work with keyboard input and have visible focus styling.\n\nRESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR\n- Design deliberately for 360px mobile, 768px tablet, 1280px desktop, and wide screens.\n- On mobile, preserve the core message and primary action, stack complex regions, reduce decorative layers, and avoid horizontal overflow.\n- Keep touch targets at least 44px, body text at least 16px where practical, and line lengths readable.\n- Media must use responsive sizing, correct aspect ratios, lazy loading below the fold, and graceful fallbacks.\n\nACCESSIBILITY AND QUALITY\n- Meet WCAG AA contrast for text and controls.\n- Add accessible names to icon-only controls, proper form labels where applicable, and descriptive alternative text for meaningful imagery.\n- Do not use color alone to communicate status. Provide clear hover, focus, active, disabled, loading, empty, and error states where relevant.\n- Reuse typed components and shared design tokens. Avoid duplicated layout code and avoid unnecessary dependencies.\n- The finished page must have no console errors, no broken links, no clipped content, and no accidental page-level horizontal scrolling.\n\nDELIVERY\n- Return a complete runnable Vite project with clean component boundaries.\n- Include a short README with install and run commands.\n- Before finishing, verify the layout at 360px, 768px, and 1440px and confirm keyboard navigation and reduced-motion behavior.",
    "promptZh": "请为一个虚构的「Hero Section」项目构建原创、可用于生产环境的前端方案。必须从零实现，不得在文字或视觉上复刻任何现有品牌。\n\n技术栈\n- React 19 + TypeScript + Vite。\n- 使用 Tailwind CSS v4 完成样式与响应式布局。\n- 使用 motion/react 实现有意义的界面动画。\n- 界面图标使用 lucide-react；不要把 emoji 当作功能图标。\n- 仅实现前端。除非可见界面明确需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n设计方向\n- 主体构图：占满首屏的开场构图、居中的视觉焦点构图。\n- 视觉语言：深色高对比配色、明亮的中性色画布。\n- 建议配色：#505050, #000000, #f8f8f8, #0e1311。把它们作为设计令牌；无障碍对比度不达标时允许调整。\n- 字体：Inter。建立清楚的展示文字、正文和 UI 层级。\n- 使用宽松的间距节奏，内容最大宽度 1180px，基础表面圆角约 12px。\n- 避免通用渐变光斑、装饰性图标矩阵、过量玻璃面板，以及不能强化信息层级的随机动画。\n\n内容与结构\n- 目标结构：高冲击首屏，包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点。\n- 适用场景：适合 Hero Section 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。\n- 创建原创的虚构品牌和精炼、结果导向的文案，让页面从第一印象到最终操作形成连贯叙事。\n- 所有名称、数据、主张、价格和评价都必须是中性、虚构且易替换的；不要伪造客户徽标、实时计数或无法证明的性能结果。\n- 使用语义化 HTML 地标；即使没有 CSS，文档层级也应清楚可理解。\n\n交互与动画\n- 主要动态语言：轻量的 3D 景深效果。\n- 常规过渡控制在 280–420ms；更长动画只用于有意设计的场景切换。\n- 优先动画 opacity 和 transform，避免触发布局抖动的属性；不要让持续动画干扰阅读。\n- 支持 prefers-reduced-motion，并提供稳定的无动画状态。\n- 每个交互控件都必须支持键盘操作并具有清晰可见的焦点样式。\n\n响应式规则\n- 分别为 360px 手机、768px 平板、1280px 桌面和宽屏做有意识的设计。\n- 手机端保留核心信息与主操作，将复杂区域纵向堆叠，减少装饰层，禁止横向溢出。\n- 触控目标至少 44px；正文在条件允许时不小于 16px；控制行长以保证可读性。\n- 媒体必须使用响应式尺寸和正确宽高比；首屏以下延迟加载，并提供优雅的失败回退。\n\n无障碍与质量\n- 文字和控件达到 WCAG AA 对比度。\n- 纯图标控件必须有可访问名称；表单使用正确标签；有意义的图片提供描述性替代文本。\n- 不要只依赖颜色表达状态；根据界面需要提供 hover、focus、active、disabled、loading、empty 和 error 状态。\n- 复用带类型的组件与共享设计令牌，避免重复布局代码和不必要的依赖。\n- 完成页面不得出现控制台错误、失效链接、内容裁切或意外的页面级横向滚动。\n\n交付要求\n- 返回完整、可运行的 Vite 项目，并保持清晰的组件边界。\n- 提供简短 README，说明安装与启动命令。\n- 交付前在 360px、768px 和 1440px 宽度下检查布局，并确认键盘导航与减少动态效果模式正常。"
